{"unit_id":"mrSutivu__plugin-effort-slider#card-zh","repo":"mrSutivu/plugin-effort-slider","commit":"00def6ea2e52b871fc75394fea5bff5b0da19131","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-effort-slider 是 DSH Web 的界面插件，在对话输入框旁组合模型菜单和推理强度滑块。它从当前会话的模型目录读取选项，仅在模型提供多个推理档位时显示。用户可浏览提供方和模型，拖动分档滑块或用键盘调整强度；最高档显示渐变。颜色跟随 DSH 主题，标签支持英语、法语和中文，并将上下文用量环移至统计栏。适合希望在编写提示时切换模型或调节 reasoning effort 的用户。需要 DSH Web 和支持多个推理档位的模型，无额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:216-217","lib/client.js:434-461","lib/client.js:392-430"]}
{"unit_id":"mrSutivu__plugin-effort-slider#card-en","repo":"mrSutivu/plugin-effort-slider","commit":"00def6ea2e52b871fc75394fea5bff5b0da19131","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"plugin-effort-slider adds a model menu and reasoning-effort slider beside DSH Web composer. It appears for models with multiple effort levels, which users can change by dragging or keyboard. The UI follows DSH themes and supports English, French, and Chinese. Requires DSH Web and compatible model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:216-217","lib/client.js:434-461","lib/client.js:392-430"]}
