{"unit_id":"mrSutivu__plugin-effort-slider#feature-1","repo":"mrSutivu/plugin-effort-slider","commit":"00def6ea2e52b871fc75394fea5bff5b0da19131","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-effort-slider 的功能「推理强度调节」：在输入框旁显示模型支持的离散档位。拖动滑块并松开，或使用方向键、Home、End 键，即可选定档位并应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:352-379","lib/client.js:420-429"]}
{"unit_id":"mrSutivu__plugin-effort-slider#feature-2","repo":"mrSutivu/plugin-effort-slider","commit":"00def6ea2e52b871fc75394fea5bff5b0da19131","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-effort-slider 的功能「模型选择」：在同一控件的菜单中按提供方列出模型。点击模型按钮打开菜单，选择一个模型后通过当前会话的目录应用选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:392-417","lib/client.js:335-340"]}
